      "created_at": "2016-02-15T03:20:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hero cards can't come into play for any reason. So avoid any environments that can play hero cards for you (EG Atlantis or Realm of Discord).<br><br>Dark Watch Mr. Fixer is awesome for this acheivement, though no matter what you do, you're going to have to get lucky.</p>",
