      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-15T12:55:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>On the Steam forum UXM266 posted steps which work well:</p><p>- Omnitron-X</p><p>- Dark Visionary</p><p>- Grandpa Legacy</p><p>vs&nbsp;</p><p>Gloomweaver in the Final Wasteland</p><p>1. Use Omnitron-X's power on Gloomweaver to trash relics or anything really</p><p>2. Use Dark Visionary to stack his deck</p><p>3. &nbsp;Use Grandpa Legacy power on either</p><p>4. &nbsp;Let Unforgiving Wasteland deal with any villain targets</p><p>5. &nbsp;Win by relic victory</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:42:49.179Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
