      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabk/{size}/1978_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-02-16T07:05:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got Extreme Hostage status by abusing poor, poor Tempest. Fighting Iron Legacy with Haka, DW Fixer, Dark Visionary, and Tempest in Jurassic Park.&nbsp;</p><ol>\n<li><span>First round Haka and Ra punch Tempest as hard as they can + choose Tempest as target for villain damage whenever possible.&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li>\n<span>Second round</span><span> forward Tempest negates all melee damage dealt to heroes.&nbsp;</span>\n</li>\n<li><span>???</span></li>\n<li><span>Profit</span></li>\n</ol>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:42:49.549Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
