      "raw": "<p>I got Extreme Hostage status by abusing poor, poor Tempest. Fighting Iron Legacy with Haka, DW Fixer, Dark Visionary, and Tempest in Jurassic Park.&nbsp;</p><ol><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">First round Haka and Ra punch Tempest as hard as they can + choose Tempest as target for villain damage whenever possible.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Second round</span><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"> forward Tempest negates all melee damage dealt to heroes.&nbsp;</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">???</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Profit</span></li></ol>",
