      "created_at": "2016-02-17T21:57:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I just went for maximum damage with Legacy, Fanatic, Ra, DW Fixer, and Haka against Baron Blade in Insula Primalis. &nbsp;14 damage a turn, and hope you don't get a Living Force Field or a Backlash Field. &nbsp;About 6 turns, unless you get an Obsidian Field or a carefully managed Velociraptor to add to that.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Same, but Mad Bomber Blade in the Final Wasteland (and you can sub in F6 AZ for Haka or Ra).&nbsp; With some help from the Wasteland, I've KO'd Blade in 4 turns.</p>\n<p>Hadn't thought about gimmicking a Gloomy Relic victory.&nbsp; Now I wanna go do that.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
