      "created_at": "2016-11-09T01:33:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I had to try this twice--I think there's a bug in the current version of the game. &nbsp;First I beat Ambuscade the old-fashioned way: Legacy, Fanatic, Dark Watch Fixer, Tempest, and Dark Visionary in Final Wasteland. &nbsp;I won, without any hero cards coming into play, but no achievement. &nbsp;Might be because I suspended the game and came back to it later.</p><p>Second try, I did the Gloomweaver thing and won at the end of round 2, and got the achievement. &nbsp;The relics were 3 of the top 4 cards in the deck!</p>",
